                                "sense_id": "bf2e4557-d226-386c-830b-d1adb13720b6",
                                "text": "So suddenly my nose and lips were emitting all of these horrible fart sounds, snorty fart sounds which only made me laugh louder, because now I was sure that nothing worse could ever happen."
